{"id":"bento-grid","title":"Bento Grid — Feature Dashboard","description":"Information packed into rounded boxes of different sizes — a bento-box grid mixing stats, a bar chart, lists and a progress ring. Fits dashboards, SaaS features and product overviews.","tags":["bento","grid","dashboard"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:26:40.538Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Bento Grid — Feature Dashboard\ndescription: Information packed into rounded boxes of different sizes — a bento-box grid mixing stats, a bar chart, lists and a progress ring. Fits dashboards, SaaS features and product overviews.\ntags: [bento, grid, dashboard]\norder: 3\n---\n\n# Bento Grid — Feature Dashboard\n\nThe Apple-style bento pattern: a CSS grid where every tile has its own size and job, tied together by one radius and one gap.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page | `#f6f7f9`, tiles `#ffffff` |\n| Border / radius | `#e7e9ee` 1px, tiles 18px |\n| Ink | `#17181c` · secondary `#6b7280` |\n| Accents | `#3b82f6` blue · `#22c55e` green · `#f59e0b` amber |\n| Type | system sans, 13px tile body, 28px stat numbers |\n\n## Layout\n\n6-column grid: a wide chart tile (2×2), counter stat, progress ring (SVG stroke), task list, team strip and a wide status banner — all breathing on a 14px gap.\n\n## Motion\n\nNumbers count up, bars grow and the ring fills on load; staggered tile entrance.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Bento Grid — Feature Dashboard\n\nThe Apple-style bento pattern: a CSS grid where every tile has its own size and job, tied together by one radius and one gap.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Page | `#f6f7f9`, tiles `#ffffff` |\n| Border / radius | `#e7e9ee` 1px, tiles 18px |\n| Ink | `#17181c` · secondary `#6b7280` |\n| Accents | `#3b82f6` blue · `#22c55e` green · `#f59e0b` amber |\n| Type | system sans, 13px tile body, 28px stat numbers |\n\n## Layout\n\n6-column grid: a wide chart tile (2×2), counter stat, progress ring (SVG stroke), task list, team strip and a wide status banner — all breathing on a 14px gap.\n\n## Motion\n\nNumbers count up, bars grow and the ring fills on load; staggered tile entrance.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Nest — Bento Dashboard\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: #f6f7f9; color: #17181c; padding: 34px 20px 60px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .head { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; }\n  h1 { font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 6px 0 4px; }\n  .head p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }\n\n  .bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 14px; }\n  .tile { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e7e9ee; border-radius: 18px; padding: 20px; grid-column: span 2; min-height: 150px; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.98); transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease; }\n  .tile.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  .t-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n  .pill { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .up { background: #e8f7ee; color: #15803d; }\n  .down { background: #fdecec; color: #b91c1c; }\n  .big { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 8px 0 2px; }\n  .sub { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }\n\n  .span4 { grid-column: span 4; }\n  .span3 { grid-column: span 3; }\n  .span6 { grid-column: span 6; }\n\n  /* chart tile */\n  .chart { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px; height: 130px; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .bar { flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #93c5fd, #3b82f6); border-radius: 8px 8px 4px 4px; height: 0; transition: height 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }\n  .bar.hot { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fcd34d, #f59e0b); }\n\n  /* progress ring */\n  .ring { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .ring svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n  .ring .track { stroke: #edf0f4; }\n  .ring .fill { stroke: #22c55e; stroke-linecap: round; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s ease; }\n\n  /* tasks */\n  ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 12px; display: grid; gap: 9px; }\n  li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; }\n  .box { width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 1.5px solid #c9ced8; border-radius: 5px; flex: none; }\n  li.done .box { background: #3b82f6; border-color: #3b82f6; position: relative; }\n  li.done .box::after { content: \"✓\"; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; position: absolute; left: 2.5px; top: -1px; }\n  li.done span { text-decoration: line-through; color: #9ca3af; }\n\n  /* team */\n  .avatars { display: flex; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .av { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid #fff; margin-left: -10px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }\n  .av:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n  .a1 { background: #6366f1; } .a2 { background: #ec4899; } .a3 { background: #14b8a6; } .a4 { background: #f59e0b; }\n  .more { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n\n  /* status banner */\n  .status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22c55e; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e8f7ee; flex: none; }\n  .status b { font-size: 14px; }\n  .status span { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6b7280; }\n  .status .link { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #3b82f6; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 780px) { .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .span4, .span3, .span6, .tile { grid-column: span 2; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eyebrow\">Nest workspace\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>Everything, one grid.\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>Weekly overview — 12 to 18 October\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bento\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span4\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Revenue \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">▲ 12.4%\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"big\">RM 24,318\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\">vs RM 21,630 last week\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"chart\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"35%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"55%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"42%\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"70%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar hot\" data-h=\"92%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"64%\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"78%\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Active users \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">▲ 3.1%\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"big\" data-count=\"8412\">0\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\">signed in this week\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Storage\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ring\">\n          \u003csvg width=\"74\" height=\"74\" viewBox=\"0 0 74 74\">\n            \u003ccircle class=\"track\" cx=\"37\" cy=\"37\" r=\"31\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"8\">\u003c/circle>\n            \u003ccircle class=\"fill\" cx=\"37\" cy=\"37\" r=\"31\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-dasharray=\"194.8\" stroke-dashoffset=\"194.8\" data-off=\"58.4\">\u003c/circle>\n          \u003c/svg>\n          \u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"big\" style=\"font-size:22px\">70%\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"sub\">12.6 / 18 GB\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span3\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Tasks due today\u003c/div>\n        \u003cul>\n          \u003cli class=\"done\">\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Ship bento layout\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Review onboarding copy\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Call design vendor\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span3\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Team online \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">6\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"avatars\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"av a1\">NA\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a2\">DK\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a3\">SR\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a4\">MF\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av more\">+4\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Nurul, Daniel, Sara and 3 others are active right now.\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span6 status\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"dot\">\u003c/span>\n        \u003cdiv>\u003cb>All systems normal\u003c/b>\u003cbr>\u003cspan>API 42ms · CDN 99.99% uptime · last incident 63 days ago\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cspan class=\"link\">View status →\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // entrance stagger\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tile').forEach((t, i) => setTimeout(() => t.classList.add('on'), 120 + i * 90));\n    // grow bars\n    setTimeout(() => document.querySelectorAll('.bar').forEach(b => b.style.height = b.dataset.h), 500);\n    // fill ring\n    setTimeout(() => document.querySelector('.ring .fill').style.strokeDashoffset = document.querySelector('.ring .fill').dataset.off, 600);\n    // count up\n    const el = document.querySelector('[data-count]');\n    const target = +el.dataset.count, t0 = performance.now();\n    (function tick(t) {\n      const p = Math.min((t - t0 - 400) / 1200, 1);\n      if (p > 0) el.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3))).toLocaleString();\n      if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n    })(performance.now());\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Nest — Bento Dashboard\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: #f6f7f9; color: #17181c; padding: 34px 20px 60px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .head { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6b7280; }\n  h1 { font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 6px 0 4px; }\n  .head p { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }\n\n  .bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 14px; }\n  .tile { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e7e9ee; border-radius: 18px; padding: 20px; grid-column: span 2; min-height: 150px; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px) scale(0.98); transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease; }\n  .tile.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  .t-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n  .pill { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .up { background: #e8f7ee; color: #15803d; }\n  .down { background: #fdecec; color: #b91c1c; }\n  .big { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 8px 0 2px; }\n  .sub { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }\n\n  .span4 { grid-column: span 4; }\n  .span3 { grid-column: span 3; }\n  .span6 { grid-column: span 6; }\n\n  /* chart tile */\n  .chart { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px; height: 130px; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .bar { flex: 1; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #93c5fd, #3b82f6); border-radius: 8px 8px 4px 4px; height: 0; transition: height 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }\n  .bar.hot { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fcd34d, #f59e0b); }\n\n  /* progress ring */\n  .ring { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 10px; }\n  .ring svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n  .ring .track { stroke: #edf0f4; }\n  .ring .fill { stroke: #22c55e; stroke-linecap: round; transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.2s ease; }\n\n  /* tasks */\n  ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 12px; display: grid; gap: 9px; }\n  li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; }\n  .box { width: 16px; height: 16px; border: 1.5px solid #c9ced8; border-radius: 5px; flex: none; }\n  li.done .box { background: #3b82f6; border-color: #3b82f6; position: relative; }\n  li.done .box::after { content: \"✓\"; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; position: absolute; left: 2.5px; top: -1px; }\n  li.done span { text-decoration: line-through; color: #9ca3af; }\n\n  /* team */\n  .avatars { display: flex; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .av { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid #fff; margin-left: -10px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }\n  .av:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n  .a1 { background: #6366f1; } .a2 { background: #ec4899; } .a3 { background: #14b8a6; } .a4 { background: #f59e0b; }\n  .more { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n\n  /* status banner */\n  .status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22c55e; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e8f7ee; flex: none; }\n  .status b { font-size: 14px; }\n  .status span { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6b7280; }\n  .status .link { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #3b82f6; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 780px) { .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } .span4, .span3, .span6, .tile { grid-column: span 2; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"head\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eyebrow\">Nest workspace\u003c/div>\n      \u003ch1>Everything, one grid.\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cp>Weekly overview — 12 to 18 October\u003c/p>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"bento\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span4\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Revenue \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">▲ 12.4%\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"big\">RM 24,318\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\">vs RM 21,630 last week\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"chart\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"35%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"55%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"42%\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"70%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar hot\" data-h=\"92%\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"64%\">\u003c/div>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"bar\" data-h=\"78%\">\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Active users \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">▲ 3.1%\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"big\" data-count=\"8412\">0\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\">signed in this week\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Storage\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ring\">\n          \u003csvg width=\"74\" height=\"74\" viewBox=\"0 0 74 74\">\n            \u003ccircle class=\"track\" cx=\"37\" cy=\"37\" r=\"31\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"8\">\u003c/circle>\n            \u003ccircle class=\"fill\" cx=\"37\" cy=\"37\" r=\"31\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-dasharray=\"194.8\" stroke-dashoffset=\"194.8\" data-off=\"58.4\">\u003c/circle>\n          \u003c/svg>\n          \u003cdiv>\u003cdiv class=\"big\" style=\"font-size:22px\">70%\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"sub\">12.6 / 18 GB\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span3\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Tasks due today\u003c/div>\n        \u003cul>\n          \u003cli class=\"done\">\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Ship bento layout\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Review onboarding copy\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n          \u003cli>\u003cspan class=\"box\">\u003c/span>\u003cspan>Call design vendor\u003c/span>\u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span3\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"t-label\">Team online \u003cspan class=\"pill up\">6\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"avatars\">\n          \u003cdiv class=\"av a1\">NA\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a2\">DK\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a3\">SR\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av a4\">MF\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"av more\">+4\u003c/div>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"sub\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Nurul, Daniel, Sara and 3 others are active right now.\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tile span6 status\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"dot\">\u003c/span>\n        \u003cdiv>\u003cb>All systems normal\u003c/b>\u003cbr>\u003cspan>API 42ms · CDN 99.99% uptime · last incident 63 days ago\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cspan class=\"link\">View status →\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // entrance stagger\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tile').forEach((t, i) => setTimeout(() => t.classList.add('on'), 120 + i * 90));\n    // grow bars\n    setTimeout(() => document.querySelectorAll('.bar').forEach(b => b.style.height = b.dataset.h), 500);\n    // fill ring\n    setTimeout(() => document.querySelector('.ring .fill').style.strokeDashoffset = document.querySelector('.ring .fill').dataset.off, 600);\n    // count up\n    const el = document.querySelector('[data-count]');\n    const target = +el.dataset.count, t0 = performance.now();\n    (function tick(t) {\n      const p = Math.min((t - t0 - 400) / 1200, 1);\n      if (p > 0) el.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3))).toLocaleString();\n      if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n    })(performance.now());\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}